Distribution requirements
-------------------------

When distributing binaries or an ISO containing copyleft components, provide
the corresponding source and build/porting changes required by that component's
license. Preserve copyright notices, license texts, disclaimers, and required
attribution in the source tree and in the installed image. Do not describe the
entire distribution as Apache-2.0 unless the statement is explicitly limited
to ReliefOS-owned code and all third-party terms remain visible.
